**xlive.def exports the `xlive` DLL ABI by binding XLive, networking, user, session, storage, and UI symbols to fixed ordinals.**

## Export Contract

`xlive` exports all entries with `NONAME`; signatures are not declared in the `.def` file.

- Networking: `xlive_XWSAStartup @1`, `xlive_XSocketCreate @3`, `xlive_XSocketClose @4`, `xlive_XSocketIOCTLSocket @6`, `xlive_XSocketSetSockOpt @7`, `xlive_XSocketBind @11`, `xlive_XSocketRecvFrom @20`, `xlive_XSocketSendTo @24`, `xlive_XSocketInet_Addr @26`, `xlive_XWSAGetLastError @27`, `xlive_XSocketHTONS @38`.
